4993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120772","id":4845094993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIMpIUQ","user":{"login":"benbarsdell","id":3979096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzkwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3979096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell","html_url":"https://github.com/benbarsdell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T15:14:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T15:14:32Z","body":"I apologize for phrasing my description poorly. Of course I do understand the problem, and I understand the code and this change well enough to know the basics of why it works. This is not something that an AI generated for me and I blindly copy-pasted into a PR. My acknowledgement was simply that I am not an expert, and that I would appreciate an expert taking a look at my changes. I would like to think I don't need to be an expert to contribute.\r\n\r\nPlease could you at least have an expert take a look at the changes. They are very small and I have provided clear video evidence that it fixes the issue. This bug has been open for 3 years and is quite significant IMO.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4845094993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4845909086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120772#issuecomment-4845909086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120772","id":4845909086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABINa0Xg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-30T16:49:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T16:49:40Z","body":"As a policy I don't review code that the contributor doesn't understand. I have a long backlog of PRs to review that need an expert's eye. It simply doesn't make sense for me to spend time on PRs that need an expert to discern whether they are an AI hallucination that happens to work in some cases, or a proper fix that handles all edge cases. \r\n\r\nWe expect that all contributors open PRs with confidence that they have submitted the correct fix and that everything in the PR logically makes sense. Then the expert can do a final quick review to confirm that the changes do indeed make sense. \r\n\r\nUltimately, I don't want to spend more time reviewing your PR than you spent creating it because I have hundreds of other PRs to review. Unless you are totally confident in the changes and can explain why the changes work and are necessary, it doesn't make sense for me to spend time reviewing the code. \r\n\r\nPlease see our rules for opening a pull request which go into further detail than I do here: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4845909086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]